# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-cityw05-0 = 
    在卫兵有所行动之前，你决定……<br><p><opt-items>...<indent>施放炼金药剂，轰破小门，随即冲入城内。<br><p><opt>...<indent>让 $ChosenOneName——队伍中最健壮者——凭 你的 之力撬开小门，率众入城。<br><p><opt-battle>...<indent>终究无法逾墙；拔剑出击，直取守卫。
msg-cityw05-1 = 
    With an ear-shattering explosion, the potion smashes open the sally port, and you rush through into the city.{" "}
msg-cityw05-2 = 
    The acid dissolves a hole in the sally port large enough for you to fit a blade through and unlatch it. Once the door is open, you race into the city, still well ahead of the guards.{" "}
msg-cityw05-3 = 
    Flames lick upward at the wooden sally port after the potion crashes at its base. Before the startled guards dare draw nearer, your group smashes against the weakened door and bursts through. Everyone is scorched by the fire, but you have escaped the guards and gotten into the city.{" "}
msg-cityw05-4 = 
    The bottle shatters, and the potion damages the tough wood and metal of the sally port, but it does not weaken it enough to permit you entry. The potion has failed. Another might complete the job -- or perhaps you had better look to other options.{" "}
msg-cityw05-5 = 
    你的挥动着臂膀，$ChosenOneName猛力一推，将闩住突门的横杠撞得粉碎。门开了，你迅速奔入城中。身后，惊慌的士兵们互相喊道：“你看见你臂膀了吗？你力气怕是如野牛一般！”
msg-cityw05-6 = 
    $ChosenOneName 使出了浑身力气，但 $he 力气不足。这处侧门本就是为抵御攻城槌而建，你休想撞开它。你身后，士兵们嘲讽地起哄，准备发动进攻。
msg-cityw05-7 = 
    战胜了那些倒霉的士兵，你环顾四周，发现还有更多敌人正向你袭来。你不愿与$PlaceName的整支军队交锋，于是转身逃回荒野。
msg-cityw05-8 = 
    脱离守卫，你奔逃出城，避过几队追兵。
msg-cityw05-9 = 
    胜利者非但不慷慨，反搜汝身以掠夺财物，继而将汝拖至旷野，弃之以饲秃鹫。
msg-cityw05-10 = 
    你投降后，士兵们在搜查你的囊袋以寻找感兴趣之物时，便用言语嘲讽你以取乐。随后，他们尽职地将你押往城中地牢，由他人来决定如何处置你。
